    mza-c-section
    
    
    "
  
  >

    

<div class="m24-c-content">
  <div class="mza-section-header no-bottom-padding has-scroll-padding">
    <div class=" mza-half-grid">
      <hgroup class="mza-hgroup">
        
        <h2 class="mza-section-heading">Why Mozilla</h2>
        <p class="mza-highlight-text">When you advertise with Mozilla, you’ll reach more people in spaces they—and you—can trust.</p>
      </hgroup>

      
        <figure class="mza-figure">
          <img alt="woman looking casually at the sky" class="" height="996" src="https://www.mozilla.org/media/cms/images/ads-why-mozilla.width-1200.png" srcset="https://www.mozilla.org/media/cms/images/ads-why-mozilla.width-1200.png 1200w, https://www.mozilla.org/media/cms/images/ads-why-mozilla.width-1400.png 1360w, https://www.mozilla.org/media/cms/images/ads-why-mozilla.width-1600.png 1360w" width="1200">
        </figure>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

    
        


  <div class="m24-c-content mza-c-home-why-moz has-scroll-padding">
    <ol class="mza-home-big-list">
      
        


  

<li class="mza-half-grid is-list-item">
  <h3 class="mza-home-big-list-heading">Our audience is incremental</h3>
  <div class="mza-home-big-list-text">


<p data-block-key="j6ghh">Mozilla’s 210M+ global users are typically hard to reach. They're usually hidden behind ad blockers, nearly half avoid dominant social media, and most say no to default platforms. They’re selective, tech savvy, and paying attention.</p></div>
</li>

      
        


  

<li class="mza-half-grid is-list-item">
  <h3 class="mza-home-big-list-heading">Our spaces are brand-safe</h3>
  <div class="mza-home-big-list-text">


<p data-block-key="udwe3">Mozilla has ridiculously high standards. We refuse to put clutter in front of our users. And there’s no unwanted surprise placements or sketchy content next to your ads. This lets you cut through the noise, make a big impact, and keep your brand squeaky clean.</p></div>
</li>

      
        


  

<li class="mza-half-grid is-list-item">
  <h3 class="mza-home-big-list-heading">Our mission drives everything</h3>
  <div class="mza-home-big-list-text">


<p data-block-key="udwe3">Mozilla is fixing what funds the internet, reinventing digital advertising from the inside. We’re creating an ad ecosystem built on trust, embedding respect, privacy, and performance into everything we do.</p></div>
</li>

      
    </ol>
  </div>

    

    
</section>
  

  
    
      

